{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_67ad10e89a7923ace210d22446d9c69172612e9134c448dc7edb3e470feee622"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The edge-pi-cli package handles CLI args and modes, a model factory, auth storage/OAuth, and settings, skills, prompts, and context."},{"claim_ids":["clm_725048b93485263b33e8782ef66faa3d0c29a58d759f2a96f66ebf83751589c7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime abstraction connects tools to a local filesystem/shell environment, with optional WebContainer and Vercel Sandbox execution environments."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8d71fa897e9d0d658adea3b0dd229a2e0f56c543ca155465065327095becd55c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The edge-pi core package contains CodingAgent, Tool Factory with tools, SessionManager, Compaction, and a runtime abstraction, per the architecture diagram."},{"claim_ids":["clm_964871baad4c438d10f588df9ac25162e45c57e7ad330dbede75e17c51868bd3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The architecture diagram lists external provider integrations: Anthropic SDK, OpenAI SDK, Google SDK, a GitHub Copilot endpoint, and the Vercel AI SDK ToolLoopAgent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c6a2d9d2b1788e90147936eebd885332bc0b7a292aa5d66e87d8dd8d5cecb631"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions are persisted as JSONL files, and a changelog entry says SessionManager is integrated with CodingAgent so history is auto-restored and persisted during generate() and stream()."}],"claim_ids":["clm_67ad10e89a7923ace210d22446d9c69172612e9134c448dc7edb3e470feee622","clm_725048b93485263b33e8782ef66faa3d0c29a58d759f2a96f66ebf83751589c7","clm_8d71fa897e9d0d658adea3b0dd229a2e0f56c543ca155465065327095becd55c","clm_964871baad4c438d10f588df9ac25162e45c57e7ad330dbede75e17c51868bd3","clm_c6a2d9d2b1788e90147936eebd885332bc0b7a292aa5d66e87d8dd8d5cecb631"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:18Z","created_by_operation":"op_aaf441acb38645dd8a67821f3a5a14df","id":"pg_14979b66cb795002a7ed0bb5991692f9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"page